        "created_at": "2016-09-14T14:14:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Playing in the Bloodsworn Colosseum the game started with \"Stonejaw\" as the first title in an (H)=3 game.</p><p>By the end of the second round Stealth Bot entered play, taking Stoneskin (did some work to set that one up).</p><p>Then things got interesting.</p><p>Taking the first hit from target Kaargra, one from Dymkharn and a hit from the Kraken gave Stealth Bot \"The Mindbreaker\".</p><p>Mind Breaker quickly earned Stealth Bot \"The Indiscriminate\", which at 2 damage earned her \"Champion\".</p><p>A tie for Fickle Fans (2+2=4) earned Stealth Bot \"Reckless\", and some timely healing form that, and other things would earn it \"The Unbreakable\".</p><p>This was all aided by [Redacted] (a not released hero that can do some healing) focusing on keeping our Golem friend alive.</p><p>So we ended up with Stealth Bot earning 6 titles, leading the team in damage and nearly taking out Unity on more than one occasion. &nbsp;Fortunately we were able to keep \"The Seeker\" off of Stealth Bot or we would have lost horribly to our berserk little friend.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:48:06.562Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
