        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-09-15T15:19:40.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I realize that the [redacted] interaction is public knowledge, so. . .</p><p>Reckless + Dr. Medico's innate power Clinical Consult was how we got Stealth Bot Unbreakable. &nbsp;Should not surprise anyone that Dr. Medico also contributed a few points to Stealth Bot's HP at other times.</p>",
